# CR 613.8a: Ygra's "Other creatures are Food artifacts" depends on the crew effect that makes Smuggler's Copter an artifact
# creature (applying the crew effect changes what Ygra's effect applies to), so it applies after it although the crew effect
# has the later timestamp. Ygra enters first; the Copter is cast two turns later and crewed by Llanowar Elves on the turn after, when it is no longer summoning sick. Crewed, the
# Copter is a Food, and has Ygra's "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this permanent: You gain 3 life", which Bot1 activates; the Copter
# is a Food going to the graveyard, so Ygra gets two counters. Before it is crewed it is no creature, so neither a Food nor
# able to activate the ability (the refusal). Llanowar Elves, a creature from the start, is a Food all along.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Ygra, Eater of All
Smuggler's Copter
Llanowar Elves
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

